    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Restaurant is a free, responsive theme tailored for restaurants, cafes, bakeries, fast food outlets, cloud kitchens, food delivery services, catering businesses, and culinary ventures, offering a visually appealing and functional platform to showcase menus, manage online orders, and sell meal kits or digital recipe guides through WooCommerce for seamless ecommerce and food ordering. With One Click Demo Import, users can quickly launch a fully designed site featuring pre-built layouts with banners highlighting chef’s specials, seasonal offers, promotions, or combo meals, while customizable sections allow easy editing of colors, fonts, and layouts without coding. Fully mobile-optimized for smooth user experience across devices, this food ecommerce theme integrates Contact Form 7 for table reservations, inquiries, catering requests, and customer feedback, Yoast SEO for better visibility on keywords like restaurant theme, online food ordering, bakery shop online, café website, fast food menu, and local food delivery, and optional integration with Charitable plugin for donation campaigns. Ideal for modern food delivery platforms, café portals, bakery stores, and fast-casual dining websites, Flex Restaurant delivers engaging menu showcases, online ordering tools, customer interaction features, and ecommerce-ready functionality, providing a stylish, user-friendly, and high-performing solution for restaurant websites."
    },
